message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "bhoonidhi-mcp: An MCP server for ISRO's Bhoonidhi EO portal"
abstract: >-
  bhoonidhi-mcp is a Model Context Protocol server that lets an AI agent
  search, save, download, and cart satellite scenes from ISRO's Bhoonidhi
  Browse & Order portal (NRSC) in natural language. It is a thin adapter over
  the bhoonidhi-downloader SDK, turning a sentence like "Sentinel-2 over
  Shillong last January" into a real search against the live portal, with
  honest reporting of what is actually available to download.
